1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,094
A hundred and five minutes. No goal. Then this.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:08,845
Spain had the ball. 65 per cent of it.

3
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:13,945
93rd minute. Williams heads, and Martínez says no.

4
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:23,456
Watch Nico Williams. He doesn't shoot. He heads it across.

5
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:27,589
To Ferran Torres. Both men came off the bench.

6
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:31,331
Left foot. Close range. 1–0.

7
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:44,368
12 shots on target. Argentina? None in 90 minutes.

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,894
Spain are champions of the world.
